sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR or Payroll Operator
    participant SYS as HRMS Payroll Engine
    participant CAL as Statutory Rules Engine
    actor APP as Approver - Finance or Founder
    participant BANK as Bank or Payment Rail
    participant GOV as Authority Portals - EPFO, ESIC, Protean, state PT
    actor EMP as Employee

    Note over HR,SYS: Month OPEN - inputs window
    HR->>SYS: Import attendance, LOP, leave
    HR->>SYS: Enter joiners, exits, revisions, arrears, one-offs
    SYS-->>HR: Validation report - blocking failures and non-blocking flags

    rect rgb(29,26,58)
    Note right of HR: GATE 1 - INPUTS_CLOSED, snapshot frozen
    HR->>SYS: Close inputs for the month
    end

    SYS->>CAL: Evaluate snapshot, rule-set version, evaluation context
    CAL-->>SYS: Wage bases, EPF, ESI, PT, LWF, TDS projection
    SYS-->>HR: PROCESSED register and variance against last month

    rect rgb(29,26,58)
    Note right of APP: GATE 2 - APPROVED by a checker, then LOCKED
    HR->>APP: Send register for approval
    APP-->>SYS: Approve, or return with notes
    end

    SYS->>EMP: Publish payslips after LOCK
    SYS->>BANK: Generate salary bank file, NEFT or IMPS batch

    rect rgb(90,30,30)
    Note right of APP: GATE 3 - payment approver releases salaries, DISBURSED
    APP->>BANK: Authorise salary release
    BANK-->>EMP: Salary credited
    end

    Note over SYS,GOV: The engine prepares artefacts, a named human submits in an attended session
    SYS-->>HR: ECR return file, ESI upload, PT data, quarterly Form 138 file for FVU
    HR->>GOV: Attended upload under the employer's written authority to act
    GOV-->>HR: Return statement for approval, or rejection with reasons
    APP->>GOV: Employer approves the ECR return statement

    rect rgb(90,30,30)
    Note right of APP: GATE 4 - statutory verification gate, then PAYMENT_INITIATED
    APP->>GOV: Initiate challan payment including any 7Q interest
    end

    GOV-->>HR: TRRN, challan receipts, Return Receipt Number
    HR->>SYS: Record acknowledgements and receipts
    SYS-->>HR: Filing ledger updated, month FILED
